(text "IN100 insect tag v4: 6.4 mm round tag, printed antenna arm, cut-off programming tab" (at 25.4 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dfa3ec61-6f56-49a4-8feb-7f9c631dee0c))
(text "- CHIP_EN, VDDQ and VCC tied together. Supply 3.3 V on the tab pads while burning the OTP; never with the cell fitted." (at 25.4 170.434 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fc046fba-fb2e-4d82-bbcf-ed9dd72e0456))
(text "- Y1 26 MHz 1612, 7 pF load: the IN100's on-chip load capacitance replaces external caps." (at 25.4 173.228 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 23b75abc-0d64-435f-a041-30c3e0dbdcea))
(text "- C1 100 nF at the VCC/VDDQ pins; C2 10 uF bulk for TX bursts from the 337 cell." (at 25.4 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 261bd5fb-980d-4252-aeec-e7e0cda41bfb))
(text "- AE1: 29.75 mm quarter-wave trace up the 0.8 mm FR-4 arm, fed straight from RF_TX (trim the arm to tune)." (at 25.4 178.816 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2da73b18-ed8e-4791-a431-1307580da7ba))
(text "- BT1: 337 / SR416SW cell under the tag on Kapton; welded tabs onto the two rim pads (+ left, - lower right)." (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 14bbaa08-87f8-4913-ad89-21b8b4ece02b))
(text "- J1: 2 x 2 plated pads on the tab (R + / T G); cut the neck after programming." (at 25.4 184.404 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 17b0e2a2-dcab-41a9-b2d6-4f8dc0002718))
(text "Derived from the IN100 datasheet reference design and SparkFun's NanoBeacon board (CC BY-SA 4.0)." (at 25.4 187.198 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5775cf94-5688-460c-9606-00226e3027af))
